{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35878","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 六 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来要自观，履春冰恐未爲难。\n自於南国同埋剑，谁向东门便挂冠。\n早是人情飞絮薄，可堪时令太行寒。\n多慙幸住匡山下，偷得穠岚坐卧看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}